{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：04:39 2026-11-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：04:39 2026-11-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：04:39 2026-11-16 HKT</p><img alt=\"資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/939dcec218edad06ff83188b41bd4ab5/2026-11/2026-11-16_4_34_53.png\"/><p>屯門發生涉酒後駕駛的交通意外。今日（16日）凌晨12時31分，一輛輕型貨車沿田景路往鳴琴路方向行駛，期間撞向一段約兩米長欄杆。</p><p>警方接報到場，發現司機身上有酒氣。經初步調查，姓劉（41歲）男司機未能通過酒精呼氣測試，涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕，現正被扣留調查。事件中無人受傷。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T21:08:15.815180+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T20:39:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T21:00:53.695077+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T21:00:53.695077+00:00","content_hash":"d72bfa7785423739cb92bf161483d02282242153a87f6e7cce1adab1f47e0b38","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}